<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila's PHIBOR rates soften across the board.</title>
<headline>Manila's PHIBOR rates soften across the board.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine interbank offered rates (PHIBOR) softened across the board on Tuesday in anticipation of an improvement in liquidity for the rest of the week, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;Liquidity is expected to increase with the maturity of an estimated 30 to 35 billion pesos worth of government securities,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>The interbank offered rates strengthened early today and on Monday due to lack of liquidity, traders said.  </p>
